'''Apeks''' is a professional esports organization founded in [[:category:Norway|Norway]] in 2017. Originally known as '''Kingpin Esports''', the team was acquired by '''ProUnite AS''' and renamed Apeks.

Apeks is known for building competitive [[VCT/2023#Semi-pro_system|Challengers]] rosters and competing in Challengers Northern Europe: [[Polaris]]. Making a name for themselves by signing strong ex-VCT talent with the goal of ascending to the International League to compete at the top echelon of VCT.

